 "what": "the Lean verifier's lincheck share of the rope-head/neox-bf16/pair unit circuit (D = 64) at two reps' coins",
 "netlist": "verity_flock.ir_lower.netlist(rope_head.lowering(templates.subcircuit('rope-head', D=64)).layout, 'rope-head/neox-bf16/pair')",
 "netlist_sha256": "6ae05fc698197e97aa112fe9237434ebd7922b2ef383cc1aa33b9ef5a0fadfbf",
 "SL": 13,
 "generator": "coins from random.Random(20261004).getrandbits(128): per rep alpha, 64 lw, 7 rho, 7 rr; the share from `lake env lean --run share.lean NET COINS` in backends/flock/verifier/lean (COINS: one 32-hex element a line, alpha, lw, rho, rr), whose source is generator_lean",
 "generator_lean": "import Flock\nopen Flock\n\ndef hexVal (c : Char) : UInt64 :=\n  if c.isDigit then (c.toNat - 48).toUInt64 else (c.toNat - 87).toUInt64\n\ndef parseF (s : String) : F128 :=\n  let cs := s.toList\n  let hi := (cs.take 16).foldl (fun acc c => acc * 16 + hexVal c) 0\n  let lo := ((cs.drop 16).take 16).foldl (fun acc c => acc * 16 + hexVal c) 0\n  \u27e8lo, hi\u27e9\n\n/-- args: NET COINS. COINS: one hex element a line: alpha, 64 lw, then h rho, then h rr (h = unitLog - 6). Prints the\ntemplate's share `project (baseOf \u03b1 (tensor lw \u03c1) a b lookup sl) (eqTable rr)`, 64 hex lines. -/\ndef main (args : List String) : IO UInt32 := do\n  let text \u2190 IO.FS.readFile (args.getD 0 \"\")\n  let lines := (text.splitOn \"\\n\").toArray\n  let lines := if lines.back? == some \"\" then lines.pop else lines\n  let net \u2190 match Net.parse lines with\n    | .ok n => pure n\n    | .error e => do IO.eprintln e; return 1\n  let cl := ((\u2190 IO.FS.readFile (args.getD 1 \"\")).splitOn \"\\n\").filter (\u00b7 \u2260 \"\") |>.toArray\n  let h := net.unitLog - 6\n  let alpha := parseF cl[0]!\n  let lw := (cl.extract 1 65).map parseF\n  let rho := (cl.extract 65 (65 + h)).map parseF\n  let rr := (cl.extract (65 + h) (65 + 2 * h)).map parseF\n  let eLo := Stmt.tensor lw rho\n  let base := Stmt.baseOf alpha eLo net.a net.b net.lookup net.unitLog\n  let p := Stmt.project base (eqTable rr)\n  IO.println s!\"UNITLOG {net.unitLog} CONST {net.constPos}\"\n  for x in p do IO.println x.toHex\n  return 0\n",
